    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d692">

                <pb facs="0805" n="720" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg720"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.00/249: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Callao-Lima</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Handley</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-05-20T09:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 20, 1919, 9
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 4.15
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to my telegram of May 12, 3 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d692-f1"/></p>
                <p>The presidential election vote Sunday and Monday in Callao-Lima Province gave
                    Leguia large majority. Present indications incomplete returns from other
                    provinces have elected him President of Peru.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Handley</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
